WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.424 --> 00:00:03.747
Unit thirteen. JavaScript Events!

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.708
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.758 --> 00:00:12.965
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.015 --> 00:00:16.853
Today we learn about JavaScript Events. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.992 --> 00:00:21.556
Event. Say it with me. Event!

6
00:00:25.063 --> 00:00:28.563
Click event. Say it with me. Click event!

7
00:00:32.072 --> 00:00:36.105
Event listener. Say it with me. Event listener!

8
00:00:39.614 --> 00:00:44.481
User interaction. Say it with me. User interaction!

9
00:00:47.971 --> 00:00:51.304
Trigger. Say it with me. Trigger!

10
00:00:54.819 --> 00:00:59.509
Respond to action. Say it with me. Respond to action!

11
00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:08.280
Interactive webpage. Say it with me. Interactive webpage!

12
00:01:11.761 --> 00:01:15.794
Event handler. Say it with me. Event handler!

13
00:01:19.292 --> 00:01:28.625
A JavaScript event, like a click event, responds to user interaction. An event listener triggers an event handler to make a webpage interactive.

14
00:01:28.675 --> 00:01:32.224
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:33.258 --> 00:01:38.457
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:38.507 --> 00:01:39.870
Event listener!

17
00:01:40.956 --> 00:01:46.037
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.087 --> 00:01:47.873
Interactive webpage!

19
00:01:49.124 --> 00:01:57.009
Did you know? Nearly every interactive feature on a modern website, from buttons to animations, relies on JavaScript events!

20
00:01:57.059 --> 00:01:59.322
Wow! I did not know that!

21
